sematic tags: tags which have some meaing and imporve SEO(Search engine organization) is called semantic tags.
example:header main footer
non semantic tags : the tags which are not in sequence and make no sense but we can use it.
example:paragragh tag div tag etc.
tables: tables have three tags tr :table row,th:table heading,td:table data 
if we need table title so we can use <caption> and give the title 
    and for merging columns to become as one column we have <colspan="2"> so by using this we can merge columns.
 

